      "title": "East Asian heatwaves intensify faster than they dissipate in a warming climate",
      "title_en": "East Asian heatwaves intensify faster than they dissipate in a warming climate",
      "title_zh": "在气候变暖的背景下，东亚地区的热浪加剧速度快于其消退速度",
      "link": "https://iopscience.iop.org/article/10.1088/1748-9326/aea00c",
      "source": "Environmental Research Letters",
      "published": "2026-09-15T23:00:00+00:00",
      "hotness": 88.5,
      "score_v1": 14.52,
      "score_v2": 88.5,
      "score_breakdown": {
